[gd_scene load_steps=2 format=3 uid="uid://edge_area3d_bad_gravity_point"]

; The issue asked for an incomplete/bad gravity_point config — but
; `gravity_point=true` with a missing/non-positive `gravity_point_unit_distance`
; is an ERROR (area3d-point-gravity-missing-distance/-invalid-distance), which
; would break the fixtureLint gate. This pins the nearest lint-safe edge case:
; `gravity_point=true` with a valid `gravity_point_unit_distance` but
; `gravity_point_center` OMITTED — Area3D falls back to its render/physics
; default center (the node's own origin) rather than erroring. Lints clean.

